#: ../../../ClangStaticAnalyzer.md:1
msgid "Clang Static Analyzer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangStaticAnalyzer.md:3
msgid ""
"The Clang Static Analyzer is a source code analysis tool that finds bugs in "
"C, C++, and Objective-C programs. It implements *path-sensitive*, *inter-"
"procedural analysis* based on *symbolic execution* technique."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangStaticAnalyzer.md:6
msgid ""
"The Static Analyzer is a part of Clang; for downloading and installing Clang "
"visit the [LLVM releases page](https://releases.llvm.org/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ClangStaticAnalyzer.md:8
msgid ""
"This is the documentation page of the Static Analyzer; there is also an old "
"[Official Tool Page](https://clang-analyzer.llvm.org/) which provides a "
"short overview of features and limitations."
msgstr ""
